#14700
The Great Tower of Xerxes - Level 5~
This area (14701-14819) forms the final level of the Great Tower of Xerxes.
The connection points are as follows:
        There are none. This area can be reached from 14626 on the 4th level.

Mob Chutes:
        14815 loads Skathor into it, allowing him to start in 6 different
        locations.

This is the final level of the tower, I expect a well-balanced group of 45th+
characters would be able to do it, IF they are sufficiently determined. There
are considerably lower numbers of mobiles here, how ever, all of them are
tougher and in particular, hit much more often, than the inhabitants of the
lower levels... There are many powerfull items here.

This area was written by Vex.
~
147 520 0 0 0 0 255 0
