0 0 14706
E
ornate archway~
        The arch is formed as the face of a sleeping child. You marvel at the
detail worked into the stone. Then, even as you watch, the child appears to
age. Fantastically fast, you see the face mature into that of a young man,
then the cheeks sink and become wrinkled, the hair thins away. All the while,
the eyes remained closed, and the expression peacefull. Then suddenly the eyes 
blink open and stare into your own. The face sneers at you with contempt,
then in a sonorous whisper, it speaks:

        "Ahh, I have watched your progress through my trials with pleasure,
you have far exceeded those deluded mortals whose only purpose is to tendure
their souls to feed my power. I must confess, I was a little surprised at your 
defeat of that demonling, Astaroth. No matter, your arrogance will be your 
downfall. Do you truly believe you can vanquish a God? Hah! Come then insects, 
I await you upon my Throne."

Then the old mans eyes close and the face rapidly changes back to its original
state.
~
E
plaque golden~
The plaque reads: "The Trial of Kings"
~
S
#14708
A corridor of white marble~
Your standing in a corridor of white marble, lit by a guttering torch on the
wall. You can't help but notice the strange pallour of the marble, making it
look some what like bone. You almost fancy you can see something writhing
beneath the surface and shuddering you look away. You decide you would
rather not know what it was. The corridor itself continues to the north and
east while the entrance lies back to the south.
~
