E
marble white~
Peering deep into the marble you see shadowy, human like forms. Their faces
are distorted with terror and they seem to be trying to reach out to you,
pleading for you to end their torment. It's as if the soul of every human
ever slain in the tower is bound into the marble that forms these walls...
You wonder why any being would want to do such a thing, and how much power
it would take to do so.
~
