An Intersection~
Your standing at an intersection in a corridor of bone white marble. You can
hear faint ethereal voices, some pleading for you to flee now while you still
can, while others laugh grimly and urge you to take the eastern corridor.
Ignoring the voices, who for all their chatter, at least seem harmless you
take in your surroundings. To the east, you see the bone white marble gives
way to simple grey stone. To the north and south, the marble corridor 
continues, while an archway in the western wall allows egress to a flight
of spiral stairs leading up.
~
