#14737
Armoury~
Like those of the training grounds outside, the walls of the armoury are of
a simple dull grey stone commonly used throughout the tower. In racks set
into the wall are a wide variety of weapons that are used in training
exercises conducted by the Weapon's Mistress to sharpen the well-honed skills
of King Xerxes elite guards. The only exit lies back to the west.
~
