#14738
Prison Cell~
This open cell holds a large number of miserable wretches whose only purpose 
is to be slain in weapons practice carried out in the large room to the west. 
The room smells badly from all the unwashed bodies contained within, while the
floor is covered in dirt and excrement. The only way out is back through the
door to the west.
