duty. Looking around, you can see various forms of entertainment they indulge
them selves in. A board on the north wall has a number of rings drawn on it,
with several knives stuck in it. You note there are a large cluster of knife
marks around the centre of the board. There are a number of chairs around a
large table in the centre of the room, there are strong leather straps
attached to the table for securing victims for torture while the guards relax
