#14756
The Dark Chapel~
Lines of pews carved from sablewood occupy the floor of the chapel, apart from
an aisle down the centre. Glowing red eyes from demonic faces rendered in
bas-relief on the walls of the Chapel provide a dim, hellish light that makes
you seem covered in blood. Even lingering in the Chapel makes you feel
tainted, as if the essence of the countless evil deeds committed here could
seep into your very soul. The taint of evil seems even stronger to the
east, where a flat altar of black marble squats upon a raised dais. It would
be far wiser to leave to the south and never return.
~
