ornate arch-way arch~
The arch is formed from blocks of black marble, the keystone is carved into
the likeness of a grinning skull. The gold-veins in the skull seem not random,
but to follow the form of arteries in the face of living creature, althou
aside from the "arteries" the skull is devoid of flesh. Far more disturbing
than this, however, is the emerald fires burning in the skulls sockets. You
have the uncanny feeling they are looking at you, regarding you as you might
a cockroach before crushing it under foot. Shuddering, you look away, trying
to tell yourself your simply imagining things.
~
