a immense hall, easily able to hold hundreds of people. The floor, ceilings
and walls are of what appears to be pure, polished onyx. Demonic visages
leer at you from bas-relief carvings on the walls, while strange symbols
are carved into the floor. The ceiling is high above you and shrouded in 
gloom. Huge candles of black wax stand to either side of the bronze doors,
shedding a dim light. The hall extends further to the north, east and south.
