Chamber of Cold~
This room is completely unlit and deathly cold, certainly nothing living could
survive in here for more than a few hours. The only furnishings in the room is
a couch of obsidian, upon which lies the shrouded form of a long dead human.
The only exit lies back to the west, it might be wise to use it.
~
