A Stone Chamber~
Behind the tapestry, you find an empty stone chamber, devoid of furnishings.
To the north, however you see a massive adamantite vault, no sign of any 
locking mechanism is visible. The eastern wall is nothing more than a strange
cloud of swirling darkness, it feels quite solid to the touch however. The
great hall lies back to the south.
~
