#14793
The Vault of Xerxes~
Entering the vault, you see that apart from the door, the walls, ceiling and
floor are also of pure adamantite. Of far more interest to you than the 
construction of the vault, how ever, is the vast wealth displayed now before
you. Of the countless offerings to the God-King over the ages, only the most
precious are secreted here, surely enough to make you all King's yourselves.
~
