#14794
Royal Chamber~
Considering the grand scale of the tower, the Royal Chamber is surprisingly
small. It is richly furnished, as you might expect, but you note a thick
layer of dust over the glitter. It would appear no one has entered this place
for a very long time. A globe of crystal in the ceiling sheds an eerie green
glow over the slowly decaying trappings of royalty. The room to the north is
dark, but there is something glowing softly on the floor. From here you can
leave north, or go back through the swirling darkness to the west.
~
