#14795
Darkness?~
The room seems at first to be completely dark, and bone-numbingly cold. Even 
the enchanted light sources in your possession shed but a faint glimmer here. 
There is something glowing softly in the darkness, however. As you approach
you see it is the form of a female lying on the ground in deep sleep. She is
beautifull beyond your experience and it is from her that the soft glow comes.
You wonder who she is and how she came to be here. Feeling around the  
blackness, you determine that the only exit lies through the force field to 
the south.
~
