#14800
Atop the Great Tower of Xerxes~
High atop the the Great Tower of Xerxes, the air is cold and thin. You marvel
at what effort of engineering and magic it must have taken the builders to 
create this massive monument, and wonder how they would feel if they had the
chance to see what it has become, the centre of a diabolical cult to a mad and
merciless God. From here you can proceed in almost all directions.
~
